  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A vivid blue phoenix tattoo on her chest and back emits faint blue light. Longevity Heaven’s Eight Extremities are named Heaven, Earth, Black, Yellow, Space, Time, Flood, and Desolate. Black Extremity is Sun Ming Lu. This woman had been staying in Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven. Immortal Zombie Giant Sun told Hei Lou Lan to listen to Desolate Extremity. Lu Tong Lan says that here Hei Lou Lan should call her Blue Phoenix Tribe Leader, and that Hei Lou Lan’s current identity is her illegitimate daughter, found while relocating the tribe. She cooks soup to expand Hei Lou Lan’s appetite, then a snake-rat soup, and shows her blue phoenix totem. She cultivates fire path. She says totems are the mainstream cultivation in Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven and the symbol of strength and status.",
      "chapters": [
        2112
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
