    {
      "text": "She is a beautiful middle aged woman. Her clothes are simple: a beast skin top and skirt. Her shoulders, tummy, and half of her breasts are exposed. On her chest and back there is a blue phoenix tattoo, vivid and lively, that emits a faint blue light.",
      "chapters": [
